                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} CFT_2
                \-duality
          %ul
            %li#ChenHungJiangLao24
              %p
                Lin Chen, Ling-Yan Hung, Yikun Jiang, Bing-Xin Lao:
                %em
                  Quantum 2D Liouville Path-Integral Is a Sum over Geometries in
