                  Einstein Gravity
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.03179"}> arXiv:2403.03179
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ning+Bao"}> Ning Bao
                , Ling-Yan Hung, Yikun Jiang, Zhihan Liu:
                %em
                  QG from SymQRG:
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msub
                          %mi AdS
                          %mn 3
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                        %msub
                          %mi CFT
                          %mn 2
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} AdS_3/CFT_2
                  Correspondence as Topological Symmetry-Preserving Quantum RG Flow
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.12045"}> arXiv:2412.12045
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            The relation to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+Teichm%C3%BCller+theory"} quantum Teichmüller theory
            is discussed/reviewed in:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/J%C3%B6rg+Teschner"}> Jörg Teschner
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On the relation between quantum Liouville theory and the quantized Teichmüller spaces
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0303149"} arxiv:hep-th/0303149
            %li#Allegretti
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dylan+Allegretti"}> Dylan Allegretti
                ,
                %em Notes on Quantum Teichmüller theory
                (
                %a{:href => "http://users.math.yale.edu/~dga4/TeichmullerNotes.pdf"}> pdf
                )
            %li#Teschner14
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/J%C3%B6rg+Teschner"}> Jörg Teschner
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Quantization of moduli spaces of flat connections and Liouville theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1405.0359"} arXiv:1405.0359
          %p
            Relation to the
            = succeed "-" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi SL
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mn 2
                    %mo ,
                    %mi ℝ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} SL(2,\mathbb{R})
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauged+WZW-model"} gauged WZW-model
            and
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/analytically+continued+Wess-Zumino-Witten+theory"} analytically continued Wess-Zumino-Witten theory
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Noboyuki+Ishibashi"}> Noboyuki Ishibashi
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Extra Observables in Gauged WZW Models
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9110071"} arXiv:hep-th/9110071
            %li
              %p
                Jian-Feng Wu, Yang Zhou,
                %em From Liouville to Chern-Simons, Alternative Realization of Wilson Loop Operators in AGT Duality
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0911.1922"}> arXiv:0911.1922
                )
          %p Further discussion:
          %ul
            %li
              Pavel Haman, Alfredo Iorio,
              %em Classical gravitational anomalies of Liouville theory
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.09825"}> arXiv:2306.09825
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/conformal+blocks"} conformal blocks
            for
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Liouville+theory"} Liouville theory
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Babak+Haghighat"}> Babak Haghighat
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yihua+Liu"} Yihua Liu
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nicolai+Reshetikhin"} Nicolai Reshetikhin
                %em Flat Connections from Irregular Conformal Blocks
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.07960"}> arXiv:2311.07960
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Xia+Gu"}> Xia Gu
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Babak+Haghighat"} Babak Haghighat
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kevin+Loo"} Kevin Loo
                %em Irregular Fibonacci Conformal Blocks
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.13358"}> arXiv:2311.13358
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Babak+Haghighat"}> Babak Haghighat
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Flat Connections from Irregular Conformal Blocks
                %a{:href => "CQTS#HaghighatFeb2024"} talk at
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/CQTS"} CQTS
                (Feb 2024) &amp;lbrack;video:
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://nyu.zoom.us/rec/share/c41GdU--I_-g2XLJ7A6T0HxK6AxI-utrlGb2mStB0XBOaJ3FrvC1JzoL_FsjWrEi.MBPR87t2nBR8f99t"} zm
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://cdnapisec.kaltura.com/p/1674401/sp/167440100/embedIframeJs/uiconf_id/23435151/partner_id/1674401?iframeembed=true&playerId=kaltura_player&entry_id=1_qyu7rg1l"} kt
          %p
            Relation ot Liouville theory to the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nambu-Goto+action"} Nambu-Goto action
          %ul
